  "title": "Chicken Piccata with Angel Hair Pasta",
  "description": "This chicken piccata pasta features pan-fried chicken and angel hair pasta drenched in a warm vinaigrette made with wine, lemon juice, and capers.",
  "authors": [
    "Reeni"
  ],
